      "en": "Praise the LORD! Sing to the LORD a new song, his praise in the assembly of the saints.",
      "ko": "할렐루야 새 노래로 여호와께 노래하며 성도의 회중에서 찬양할찌어다",
      "source_text_hash": "5e27f37b408dd333dfcdb2ea8493e7da340831b0fa014b7793dee0850d16abd9",
      "translation_text_hash": "8f02674e8bac95d8dc956e125175676e9987f735c3deec5a6ce90eb868c51d7e",
