      "en": "For the LORD takes pleasure in his people. He crowns the humble with salvation.",
      "ko": "여호와께서는 자기 백성을 기뻐하시며 겸손한 자를 구원으로 아름답게 하심이로다",
      "source_text_hash": "2caf6a471af12d293a5db2b8e1f70ce81ebe83fff0673575bc50f8ede8f52fca",
      "translation_text_hash": "7546cb6ccf7d876b726c188ffab3cea88fc5c5d08e02787018213515809b7562",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
