      "en": "May the high praises of God be in their mouths, and a two-edged sword in their hand,",
      "ko": "그 입에는 하나님의 존영이요 그 수중에는 두 날 가진 칼이로다",
      "source_text_hash": "719359d74ff04c82079611982afa7a398151522ebc8e7c6d4553bce9bbd4aa40",
      "translation_text_hash": "0d0b4f6a28001823ec07f7e0e11dd8bc9c73936acfb64fbe9862a7c9fbe6f2ab",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "그 입에는 하나님의 존영이요 그 수중에는 두 날 가진 칼이로다"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "0d0b4f6a28001823ec07f7e0e11dd8bc9c73936acfb64fbe9862a7c9fbe6f2ab"
