      "en": "to bind their kings with chains, and their nobles with fetters of iron;",
      "ko": "저희 왕들은 사슬로, 저희 귀인은 철고랑으로 결박하고",
      "source_text_hash": "7a39490e50796b9e86c7bf05cb45a2e26f73aa3375d1cc7f0cdf85f133d3f1ce",
      "translation_text_hash": "3930b6ee0f211f1d4d410072d7f278c8c6799084c8ecca72e368a94e3fdbeb1f",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
